                        "code": "// Hall of Mirrors: fourfold fold around the centre, the highs rotate it\nvec2 warp(vec2 uv)\n{\n    vec2 d = abs(uv - 0.5);\n    float dreh = 0.2 * sin(uTime * 0.3) + 0.3 * treb;\n    float s = sin(dreh);\n    float c = cos(dreh);\n    return 0.5 + mat2(c, -s, s, c) * d;\n}\n",
